      "updated": 1771968417857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In plain English:  LoginComponent (high-level) should NOT hard-code  new AuthService()  (low-level detail).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In plain English:  LoginComponent (high-level) should NOT hard-code  new AuthService()  (low-level detail).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "solid_plain2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 849,
      "width": 925.0899658203125,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#15803d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 627114987,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1351387557,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968417857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Instead, both depend on a CONTRACT (interface / token). Angular's @Injectable + inject() IS this principle in action.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instead, both depend on a CONTRACT (interface / token). Angular's @Injectable + inject() IS this principle in action.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
