      "text": "Rule 1: High-level classes should NOT depend on low-level classes. Both should depend on\nABSTRACTIONS.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rule1",
      "originalText": "Rule 1: High-level classes should NOT depend on low-level classes. Both should depend on ABSTRACTIONS.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5Y9r3K9KrouzGfMX5IgI6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85.54647827148438,
      "y": 755.59765625,
