    {
      "id": "GNOYTtX_wwGofo-yCjJZi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 42.79344940185547,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 114.41310119628906,
      "height": 65,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d97706",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 716905541,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 941825400,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. You write\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn:'root'\n})",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "s1",
      "originalText": "1. You write\n@Injectable({\n  providedIn:'root'\n})",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FIV1OQF3p5U_HVAboVlPz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 240.46344757080078,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 99.07310485839844,
      "height": 65,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ea580c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 63860011,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 625055240,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Angular adds\nAuthService to\nits registry\nat app start",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "s2",
      "originalText": "2. Angular adds\nAuthService to\nits registry\nat app start",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pL_bxEESJTvDpDpEaz1mG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 432.30995178222656,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 120.38009643554688,
      "height": 65,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1052534373,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 2043719288,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Component calls\ninject(AuthService)\nAngular sees the\nrequest",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "s3",
      "originalText": "3. Component calls\ninject(AuthService)\nAngular sees the\nrequest",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Zmpbh7Nz5L_hsCCVslrgW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 637.2449417114258,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 120.51011657714844,
      "height": 65,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1768839435,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1269929224,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Already exists?\nReturn same one.\nFirst time?\nCreate it. Store it.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "s4",
      "originalText": "4. Already exists?\nReturn same one.\nFirst time?\nCreate it. Store it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R67KFiSvbRRDuEmJpLdwX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 838.3444519042969,
      "y": 1053.125,
      "width": 103.31109619140625,
      "height": 48.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#16a34a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1906074757,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 832839544,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Component\ngets the service\nready to use!",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "s5",
      "originalText": "5. Component\ngets the service\nready to use!",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Poak7MuePgLrK_5IrtpN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 53.75140380859375,
      "y": 1243.75,
      "width": 312.4971923828125,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1879542757,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1103737864,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: What is a dependency?\n\nAnything your class NEEDS to work.\nAuthService needs HttpClient.\nHttpClient is a dependency of AuthService.\nDI = someone else provides it for you.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq1",
      "originalText": "Q: What is a dependency?\n\nAnything your class NEEDS to work.\nAuthService needs HttpClient.\nHttpClient is a dependency of AuthService.\nDI = someone else provides it for you.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "O5u7FG8UiaDAIK6ncDyRS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 461.5839538574219,
      "y": 1243.75,
      "width": 292.83209228515625,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7c3aed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2035730245,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1608609912,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: What is the Injector?\n\nAngular's internal waiter.\nIt holds a MAP of tokens to instances.\nWhen you call inject(X), it looks up X\nin the map and hands it to you.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq2",
      "originalText": "Q: What is the Injector?\n\nAngular's internal waiter.\nIt holds a MAP of tokens to instances.\nWhen you call inject(X), it looks up X\nin the map and hands it to you.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fVnWhEp1LntJrdulbJSl2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 857.7614135742188,
      "y": 1243.75,
      "width": 296.4771728515625,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#16a34a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1072141989,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 495317768,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: What does @Injectable() actually do?\n\nIt tells TypeScript to keep metadata\nabout the class so Angular's injector\ncan find and create it.\nWithout it, inject() silently fails.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq3",
      "originalText": "Q: What does @Injectable() actually do?\n\nIt tells TypeScript to keep metadata\nabout the class so Angular's injector\ncan find and create it.\nWithout it, inject() silently fails.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QMT0HpG3RPRBvUYrfl0qu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38.63877868652344,
      "y": 1398.75,
      "width": 342.7224426269531,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d97706",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1315404293,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1548525944,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: What is the Dependency Inversion Principle?\n\nHigh-level code should NOT depend\non low-level code directly.\nBoth depend on an abstraction.\nAngular DI enforces this automatically.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq4",
      "originalText": "Q: What is the Dependency Inversion Principle?\n\nHigh-level code should NOT depend\non low-level code directly.\nBoth depend on an abstraction.\nAngular DI enforces this automatically.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nBd_kXlE0-k5nLBRkW5s_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 453.0189208984375,
      "y": 1395.375,
      "width": 309.962158203125,
      "height": 131.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0d9488",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2111041893,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1432506888,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: How do you swap a service for testing?\n\nIn your test: provide a mock.\nTestBed.configureTestingModule({\n  providers: [{ provide: AuthService,\n  useClass: MockAuthService }]\n})",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq5",
      "originalText": "Q: How do you swap a service for testing?\n\nIn your test: provide a mock.\nTestBed.configureTestingModule({\n  providers: [{ provide: AuthService,\n  useClass: MockAuthService }]\n})",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JWEyftElpHEaUW5GhKeUg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 852.2564086914062,
      "y": 1398.75,
      "width": 307.4871826171875,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1024220683,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1714008696,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771968568579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: inject() vs @Inject() decorator?\n\ninject() = modern function call.\nWorks anywhere in injection context.\n@Inject() = old decorator on constructor.\nYou will see both in older code.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iq6",
      "originalText": "Q: inject() vs @Inject() decorator?\n\ninject() = modern function call.\nWorks anywhere in injection context.\n@Inject() = old decorator on constructor.\nYou will see both in older code.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
